WEBVTT

00:12:29.621 --> 00:12:34.329
and Vandeleur work on precarious manhood,
which it basically says, look,

00:12:34.329 --> 00:12:37.704
you know, the problem with most
definitions of masculinity

00:12:37.704 --> 00:12:42.454
or masculine cultures is we have
to demonstrate it over and over

00:12:42.454 --> 00:12:43.454
and over again.

00:12:43.579 --> 00:12:46.121
And so no matter how many times
you've proven your strength,

00:12:46.454 --> 00:12:49.246
if you show just one tiny bit of weakness,

00:12:49.579 --> 00:12:52.787
then all of a sudden you're no longer
a man or you're no longer strong.

00:12:53.246 --> 00:12:56.246
I don't know. Have you been reading
any of that work? Well, I.

00:12:56.246 --> 00:12:59.329
I found it by asking some folks
on my research team what is

00:12:59.329 --> 00:13:01.246
an alternative to toxic masculinity.